==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 12.67 seconds<sup>380f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Akuma (Enemy)|Akuma]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can beat this stage by spamming [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and properly meatshielding. Using their [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Variants]] works even better. Any good generalist [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats#The Almighties The Majestic Zeus|Uber Rares]] come in helpful as well, as long as they have decent stats and range. Notably, Akuma has 550 effective range, so any Ubers with greater range are useful when properly protected.

